e her students  and co-workers in the battle of hogwarts  taking down at least one death eater  herself  after the battle we can only assume that  madame pomfrey returned to her regular  post tending to the various medical  maladies that came through the doors of  the hogwarts hospital wing if you want  to go by cursed child cannon then we do  actually know for certain that she was  still working at the school in 2020  10. mundungus fletcher mandungus  fletcher was a half-bud wizard with a  rich history of criminal activity  there aren't many positive ways to  describe mandungus as a person as  throughout the story he always seemed to  be getting into trouble and getting on  people's bad sides  mandungus is even partly responsible for  the death of moody as he abandoned him  during the battle of the seven potters  he also shamelessly raids number 12  grimmeld place  looting and selling all of the valuables  that lay within  after being confronted by harry for this  he disappeared and went into hiding  that is until he was imprisoned in  azkaban for impersonating ninfurious  it's unlikely that mundungus played any  part in the battle of hogwarts and it's  likely that he simply returned to his  life as a questionable and unauthorized  dealer of magical artifacts and that's  it for this video i've got 16 more  characters to cover in this series noted  down but there may still be some that  i've missed if you want to request a  particular character then leave a  comment down below links to part 1 2 3  and 4 are in the pinned comment  if you want to support the channel then  please like the video and subscribe  until next time remember  it does not do to dwell on dreams and  forget to live  [Music]  you

